ai "Center Fielder"
about "Nothing gets behind him. Takes the deep angle, tackles last."
position S
dials aggression 0.35 discipline 0.9 vision 0.75

rules:
  when before the throw and assignment is zone and deep threat -> stay deep
  when ball in air -> play the ball
  when enemy has the ball and not carrier within 9 -> stay deep
  when carrier within 2 -> wrap up
  otherwise -> follow assignment
